ivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d98\"},\"ref\":\"d98\",\"snippet\":\" ... born 1966) – singer, born in Gary, Indiana\\n*Jane Jacobs (1916–2006) – economist, urban theorist, and activist\\n*JonTron (born 1990) – YouTuber, co-creator o\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_people_from_New_York_City\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d97\"},\"ref\":\"d97\",\"snippet\":\" ... Zadie Smith - Wikipedia\\nauthor: Authority control databases\\ndate: 2003-08-24\\n---\\nname: Zadie Smith\\nhonorific_suffix: FRSL\\nbirth_name: Sadie Smith\\nbirth_dat\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zadie_Smith\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d96\"},\"ref\":\"d96\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ward\\n\\n2011\\n\\nThe Round House\\n\\nLouise Erdrich\\n\\n2012\\n\\nAmericanah\\n\\nChimamanda Ngozi Adichie\\n\\n2013\\n\\nNevada\\n\\nImogen Binnie\\n\\n2013\\n\\nA Brief History of Seven Killin\",\"title\":\"https://www.theatlantic.com/books/archive/2024/03/best-books-american-fiction/677479/\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d95\"},\"ref\":\"d95\",\"snippet\":\" ... Guardian Books Nigeria Limited, 1988), pp. 60–67\\n* Ogwude, Sophia O., \\\"History and Ideology in Chimamanda Adichie's Fiction\\\", Tydskrif Vir Letterkunde, 48.\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Thing_Around_Your_Neck\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d94\"},\"ref\":\"d94\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2021-05-12\\n---\\nNigeria Football League 2016\\n\\nFederation Cup 2016\\n\\nFinal Table: 1.Enugu Rangers International FC 36 18 9 9 53-37 63 [1-0] Champions 2.Rivers\",\"title\":\"https://www.rsssf.org/tablesn/nig2016.html\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d93\"},\"ref\":\"d93\",\"snippet\":\" ... These are the stories that we never believed could be told, until